{"id":"74e0b51f1b8e81e1","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-zero-knowledge.md","title":"Computational Zero Knowledge","display":"df-zero-knowledge — Computational Zero Knowledge","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-zero-knowledge","aliases":["28-df-zero-knowledge","Computational Zero Knowledge"],"display":"df-zero-knowledge — Computational Zero Knowledge","depends_on":["[[28-df-view]]","[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-negl]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 9.14 and §9.4 computational relaxation, Exercise 9.17; printed pp.187–188,199; PDF pp.213–214,225","source_printed_pages":"187–188,199","source_pdf_pages":"213–214,225","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-zero-knowledge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-zero-knowledge</span><span>Computational Zero Knowledge</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-knowledge — Computational Zero Knowledge"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e6a863785f69243\" href=\"?note=8e6a863785f69243\" title=\"28-df-view\">28-df-view</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 9.14 and §9.4 computational relaxation, Exercise 9.17; printed pp.187–188,199; PDF pp.213–214,225"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"187–188,199"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"213–214,225"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(R\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为多项式时间可判定关系，存在多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x,u)\\Rightarrow |u|\\le p(|x|)\">\\(R(x,u)\\Rightarrow |u|\\le p(|x|)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\;R(x,u)\">\\(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\;R(x,u)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(s,H)\">\\(P=(s,H)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e6a863785f69243\" href=\"?note=8e6a863785f69243\" title=\"28-df-view\">28-df-view</a> 的证明者表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 为该定义中的总消息函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,V)\">\\((P,V)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的交互证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,u)\">\\((x,u)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上交互；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x,u)\">\\(R(x,u)\\)</span> 完备性至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3\">\\(2/3\\)</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin L\">\\(x\\notin L\\)</span>、任意无界证明者策略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^*\">\\(P^*\\)</span>，健全性错误至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/3\">\\(1/3\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,V\">\\(P,V\\)</span> 在任意收到的消息流上自身执行的时间、随机位及消息长度均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x|\">\\(|x|\\)</span> 多项式有界，超长消息可由计时器截断。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IV}\">\\(\\mathsf{IV}\\)</span>、验证者元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=(k_W,b_W,p_W,Q_W,D_W)\">\\(W=(k_W,b_W,p_W,Q_W,D_W)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>；每个作弊验证者按固定多项式轮数、随机带及消息界补空消息并加计时器表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{P,R}\">\\(\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\)</span> 是下式定义的、消息界足够容纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 有效证书输出的验证者表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为任意有限消息历史，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为任意证明者随机带。任何均匀多项式时间作弊策略都可把界放大到共同多项式并在超时或格式错误时停止，纳入此表示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e6a863785f69243\" href=\"?note=8e6a863785f69243\" title=\"28-df-view\">28-df-view</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\">\\(S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\)</span> 是仅输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的独立模拟器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 为一比特输出区分器，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))\">\\(D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a> 的二串编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 为视图或模拟输出的二进制串，所有新抽取的随机带相互独立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CZK}(P,V,L,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{CZK}(P,V,L,R)\\)</span> 为本节点的计算零知识谓词；不额外要求 auxiliary-input 安全性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\coloneqq\\left\\{W\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall x,u,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow |H(x,u;r,h)|\\le b_W(|x|)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\coloneqq\\left\\{W\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall x,u,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow |H(x,u;r,h)|\\le b_W(|x|)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CZK}(P,V,L,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall V^*\\in\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow\\left|\\Pr[D(x,\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u))=1]-\\Pr[D(x,S(x))=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(|x|)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CZK}(P,V,L,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall V^*\\in\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow\\left|\\Pr[D(x,\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u))=1]-\\Pr[D(x,S(x))=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(|x|)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义 9.14 的模拟器为期望多项式时间，不能直接改成最坏情形 PPT。§9.4 与 Exercise 9.17 给出计算不可区分放宽，但 Exercise 9.17 具体只量化可采样的真输入/证书系综。本节点保留逐真输入、逐有效证书的统一界，属于明确标识的较强补充接口，不能据该书练习将两者标为相同定义。这样也避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in L\">\\(x\\in L\\)</span> 索引系综错误代入仅按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的关系。作弊验证者可以把视图作为最终输出，故本接口与书中“所有最终输出均可模拟”的含义一致。未声明更强的任意辅助输入版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-view","status":"resolved","id":"8e6a863785f69243","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-view]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-view","status":"resolved","id":"8e6a863785f69243","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P=(s,H)$ 采用 [[28-df-view]] 的证明者表示；$s\\in\\mathbb N[n]$，$H$ 为该定义中的总消息函数。$(P,V)$ 是 $L$ 的交互证明：$P$ 在 $(x,u)$、$V$ 在 $x$ 上交互；对每个 $R(x,u)$ 完备性至少 $2/3$，对每个 $x\\notin L$、任意无界证明者策略 $P^*$，健全性错误至多 $1/3$。$P,V$ 在任意收到的消息流上自身执行的时间、随机位及消息长度均以 $|x|$ 多项式有界，超长消息可由计时器截断。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{IV}$、验证者元组 $W=(k_W,b_W,p_W,Q_W,D_W)$ 来自 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]；每个作弊验证者按固定多项式轮数、随机带及消息界补空消息并加计时器表示。$\\mathcal V_{P,R}$ 是下式定义的、消息界足够容纳 $P$ 有效证书输出的验证者表示；$h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}$ 为任意有限消息历史，$r\\in\\Sigma^*$ 为任意证明者随机带。任何均匀多项式时间作弊策略都可把界放大到共同多项式并在超时或格式错误时停止，纳入此表示。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-view","status":"resolved","id":"8e6a863785f69243","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)$ 见 [[28-df-view]]；$S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}$ 是仅输入 $x$ 的独立模拟器，$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))$，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 使用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的二串编码；$z$ 为视图或模拟输出的二进制串，所有新抽取的随机带相互独立。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)$ 见 [[28-df-view]]；$S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}$ 是仅输入 $x$ 的独立模拟器，$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))$，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 使用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的二串编码；$z$ 为视图或模拟输出的二进制串，所有新抽取的随机带相互独立。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)$ 见 [[28-df-view]]；$S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}$ 是仅输入 $x$ 的独立模拟器，$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))$，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 使用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的二串编码；$z$ 为视图或模拟输出的二进制串，所有新抽取的随机带相互独立。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)$ 见 [[28-df-view]]；$S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}$ 是仅输入 $x$ 的独立模拟器，$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))$，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 使用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的二串编码；$z$ 为视图或模拟输出的二进制串，所有新抽取的随机带相互独立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"R(x,u)\\Rightarrow |u|\\le p(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\;R(x,u)","display":false},{"tex":"P=(s,H)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"(P,V)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"(x,u)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"R(x,u)","display":false},{"tex":"2/3","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"P^*","display":false},{"tex":"1/3","display":false},{"tex":"P,V","display":false},{"tex":"|x|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IV}","display":false},{"tex":"W=(k_W,b_W,p_W,Q_W,D_W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{P,R}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"D(x,z)=D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,z))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CZK}(P,V,L,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\coloneqq\\left\\{W\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall x,u,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow |H(x,u;r,h)|\\le b_W(|x|)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CZK}(P,V,L,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall V^*\\in\\mathcal V_{P,R}\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\;\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[R(x,u)\\Rightarrow\\left|\\Pr[D(x,\\operatorname{View}_{V^*}^P(x,u))=1]-\\Pr[D(x,S(x))=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(|x|)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"x\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":3630,"backlinks":[{"id":"278046f9a093bf22","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$P=(s,H)$ 采用 [[28-df-view]] 的带固定随机长度的证明者表示；$L,R,(P,V)$、$\\Sigma$、证书界及完备性、健全性采用 [[28-df-zero-knowledge]] 的前提；这里固定协议规定的诚实验证者 $V$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"零知识：[[28-df-honest-verifier-zero-knowledge]]、[[28-df-zero-knowledge]]。"}],"outgoing":["8e6a863785f69243","3e270c20bc5033b3","b75200f005282ddf","f3171800627deef3"]}